  ('Sip & Script | Modern Calligraphy for Beginners at McGrail Vineyards', 'sip-script-modern-calligraphy-for-beginners-at-mcgrail-vineyards-3dafe9', 'Tuesday, September 15th 5:30-7:00PM Join Sip & Script for Modern Calligraphy Fun! Join us at McGrail Vineyards in Livermore, CA for pretty lettering! Whether you’re a stationery nerd, DIY Bride-to-be, or just a crafty individual, you’ll be introduced to modern calligraphy with a pointed dip pen and ink in this workshop. We will cover all the basics and prepare you to add those unique lettered details to your snail mail, wedding paper goods, home decor, and more! The perfect crafty night out! Tickets include 1.5 hours of instruction and demonstration, our beginner’s calligraphy kit (two nibs, black ink pot, 2 letter guides, tracing paper, and straight pen holder), and all materials to write on. Everything is yours to keep at the end of the workshop! Feel free to arrive a little early, settle into your spot, and enjoy award-winning McGrail wines, available for purchase throughout the…', '2026-09-15T19:30:00-07:00', null, 'McGrail Vineyards and Winery', '5600 Greenville Road, Livermore, CA 94550', 'food-drink', array['tri-valley']::text[], '75', false, false, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', 'https://www.sipandscript.com/events/modern-calligraphy-for-beginners-at-mcgrail-vineyards-and-winery-in-livermore-1/', (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-livermore-valley-wine-country'), 'https://www.lvwine.org/events/2026/9/September.html', 'approved', 'scraper', '3dafe96540e0'),
