  ('TVTC Presents Spooktacular Broadway 2', 'tvtc-presents-spooktacular-broadway-2-e9283b', 'Step into a night where Broadway meets the supernatural. Spooktacular Broadway 2 returns with a new collection of hauntingly beautiful songs, thrilling performances, and plenty of theatrical surprises. From wicked witches and mysterious phantoms to playful monsters and ghostly favorites, this cabaret celebrates the unforgettable characters and music that make Broadway delightfully spooky. Gather your fellow theater lovers and join Tri-Valley Theatre Company for an evening filled with chills, laughter, and show-stopping performances. Whether you love classic musicals or modern Broadway hits, Spooktacular Broadway 2 promises a frightfully fun night where the curtain rises on the supernatural.', '2026-10-02T19:00:00-07:00', null, 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'arts', array['Presenting Series','pleasanton']::text[], '$24 – $34', false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Spooktacular2-web-1920x1080-1.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/spooktacular-broadway-2/', 'approved', 'scraper', 'e9283b3f8dbd'),
