  ('Garratt Wilkin & The Parrotheads', 'garratt-wilkin-the-parrotheads-df55fc', 'Escape to a tropical paradise with Garratt Wilkin & The Parrotheads, the nation’s premier celebration of the music of Jimmy Buffett. Since 1999, this Northern California-based tribute band has delighted audiences with the laid-back island vibes, unforgettable songs, and beach party atmosphere that have made Buffett a legend. Headlining fairs and festivals across North America, the Parrotheads faithfully recreate the sound, energy, and spirit of a live Jimmy Buffett concert. So grab your flip-flops, embrace your inner Parrothead, and get ready for an evening filled with good times and memories. Learn more at https://www.theparrotheads.com/ .', '2026-10-09T19:30:00-07:00', null, 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'music', array['Presenting Series','pleasanton']::text[], '$35 – $43', false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Parrotheads-web-1920x1080-1.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/garratt-wilkin-the-parrotheads/', 'approved', 'scraper', 'df55fc31a6ac'),
