  ('Harvest Festival Original Art & Craft Show', 'harvest-festival-original-art-craft-show-d2a2ef', 'For 53 years the nation&''s most talented artisans have successfully sold their creations at the Harvest Festival® Original Art & Craft Shows. We have seven established venues that attract thousands of eager shoppers with their "shop till you drop" attitude, looking for their next treasures to purchase. Don''t miss your opportunity to join us on our 2026 tour. No application or jury fee. Category limitations. No commission on sales. Indoor booths in climate-controlled facilities, hotel discounts, exhibitor shipping, 24 hr. security. No buy & sell, commercial, or imported products allowed in our artisan booths. Extensive marketing in all medias.3.5 mi', '2026-10-25T00:00:00-07:00', null, 'Alameda County Fairgrounds', 'Pleasanton, CA', 'festival', array['pleasanton']::text[], null, false, true, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533174072545-7a4b6ad7a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/harvest-festival-original-art-craft-show/18073418/2026-10-25T00', 'approved', 'scraper', 'd2a2efeec432'),
