  ('Karaoke Saturday!Charles R. Vineyards', 'karaoke-saturday-charles-r-vineyards-601c1a', 'Get ready to unleash your inner rock star at Karaoke Saturday! Doors swing open at noon. Rally your pals and prepare for a day packed with epic sing-alongs! And let’s be honest, a glass of wine is the perfect sidekick for those high notes! No need to book a spot; just waltz in and let the fun begin!', '2026-11-14T12:00:00-07:00', null, null, 'Livermore, CA', 'music', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/1K4em3pyK0WMvCjCHOnIGQ.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/karaoke-saturday-/18640517/2026-11-14T12', 'approved', 'scraper', '601c1ad07e16'),
  ('PYTC | School of Rock Young Actors Edition', 'pytc-school-of-rock-young-actors-edition-f1d4f9', 'Rock got no reason, rock got no rhyme… You better get me to school on time! Andrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie, designed especially for young performers. The tuner follows Dewey Finn, a failed, wannabe rock star who decides to earn an extra bit of cash by posing as a substitute teacher at a prestigious prep school. There he turns a class of straight-A pupils into a guitar-shredding, bass-slapping, mind-blowing rock band. But can he get them to the Battle of the Bands without their parents and the school’s headmistress finding out? The Playlist Cast performs on the following dates: Saturday, November 7 at 7pm Sunday, November 8 at 2pm Friday, November 13 at 7pm Saturday, November 14 at 2pm The Mixtape Cast performs on the following dates: Friday, November 6 at 7pm Saturday, November 7 at 2pm…', '2026-11-14T14:00:00-07:00', '2026-11-14T15:00:00-07:00', 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'music', array['Presenting Series','Presenting Series|Youth Program','Youth Program','pleasanton']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1252x720-scaled.jpg', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/pytc-school-of-rock-young-actors-edition/2026-11-14/1/', 'approved', 'scraper', 'f1d4f9f6da53'),
  ('KARAOKE SATURDAY AT CHARLES R VINEYARDS', 'karaoke-saturday-at-charles-r-vineyards-8c207f', 'Sing your favorite song while sipping on your favorite wine. Bring a picnic, your favorite people, and a song!', '2026-11-14T16:30:00-07:00', null, 'Charles R Vineyards', '8195 Crane Ridge Road (5800 Greenville Road), Livermore, CA 94550', 'music', array['tri-valley']::text[], 'Free', true, false, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517457373958-b7bdd4587205?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-livermore-valley-wine-country'), 'https://www.lvwine.org/events/2026/11/November.html', 'approved', 'scraper', '8c207f461759'),
  ('Saturday at RETZLAFF - Live music by Loren Olk', 'saturday-at-retzlaff-live-music-by-loren-olk-793108', 'Come for wine tasting or a bottle picnic and enjoy live music by Loren Olk at charming Retzlaff Vineyards. Reservations are appreciated. Club members enjoy picnic tables for 6 persons quarterly tastings at no charge. Snacks available for purchase. A minimum wine purchase is required for all picnic groups. Kids and well behaved dogs are welcome. No outside alcohol allowed.', '2026-11-14T16:30:00-07:00', null, 'Retzlaff Organic Vineyards and Estate Winery', '1356 South Livermore Ave., Livermore, CA 94550', 'music', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517457373958-b7bdd4587205?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', 'https://retzlaffvineyards.com/', (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-livermore-valley-wine-country'), 'https://www.lvwine.org/events/2026/11/November.html', 'approved', 'scraper', '793108dd43dd'),
  ('Tracy Cruz Music', 'tracy-cruz-music-a9a2e4', 'Multi-award winning R&B/Soul/Jazz music artist Tracy Cruz will be performing LIVE with her talented band at Las Positas Vineyards in Livermore, CA. 6-8:30 pm. $5 reservations but reservations are needed. Enjoy delicious food, live music, and wine. Bennett Roth (keys) Aaron Green (drums) www.tracycruzmusic.com www.facebook.com/tracycruzmusicpage www.twitter.com/tracycruzmusic www.instagram.com/tracycruzmusic', '2026-11-14T18:00:00-07:00', null, 'Las Positas Vineyards', 'Livermore, CA', 'music', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/lfrrufoqVkKu67co-h42BQ.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/tracy-cruz-music/16494801/2026-11-14T18', 'approved', 'scraper', 'a9a2e444320c'),
  ('MARK BETTENCOURT and the AFTERMATH', 'mark-bettencourt-and-the-aftermath-f7b711', 'Mark Bettencourt and the Aftermath is probably the highest energy band you will ever see. Lead vocalist Mark Bettencourt brilliantly covers songs that you forgot you loved! The Band hails from the now famous Silicon Valley. You may have experienced the Aftermath at one of their many prestigious events such as: The San Jose Grand Prix, Rotary club events, Street Fairs, Corporate events, Yacht clubs as well a many local music bars and night clubs. But no matter where you choose to come experience the band, you will be guaranteed to be taken back to a place where you can unplug and just enjoy yourself! We consider ourselves among the luckiest to know who we know and to do what we do. Thank you! For booking information contact: Mark Bettencourt @ (408) 421-8718 aftermathmb7@gmail.com', '2026-11-14T21:00:00-07:00', null, 'Meenar Music Club', 'Danville, CA', 'music', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/8buU-LGOl0Osg1e0xZukww.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/mark-bettencourt-and-the-aftermath/16380906/2026-11-14T21', 'approved', 'scraper', 'f7b711216fe9'),
  ('Livermore Farmers'' Market', 'livermore-farmers-market-5cdef9', 'The Livermore Farmers'' Market is Sunday, year-round. 9 a.m.-1 p.m., 206 South J St.', '2026-11-15T09:00:00-07:00', null, null, 'Livermore, CA', 'market', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, true, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/c044a9d0-a3c2-417b-94d5-c25e57f22287.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/livermore-farmers-market/17775650/2026-11-15T09', 'approved', 'scraper', '5cdef9e4473a'),
  ('Volunteer at Valley Humane Society', 'volunteer-at-valley-humane-society-f0c2ec', 'Join Valley Humane Society''s valued team of volunteers for a rewarding experience that has a meaningful impact on the lives of animals and people in the community. Visit valleyhumane.org/volunteer.', '2026-11-15T10:00:00-07:00', null, null, 'Pleasanton, CA', 'community', array['pleasanton']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/68646135-c187-4347-82fb-2e38ce872f78.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/volunteer-at-valley-humane-society/13565994/2026-11-15T10', 'approved', 'scraper', 'f0c2ec9ba37c'),
  ('PYTC | School of Rock Young Actors Edition', 'pytc-school-of-rock-young-actors-edition-27181b', 'Rock got no reason, rock got no rhyme… You better get me to school on time! Andrew Lloyd Webber’s School of Rock: Young Actors Edition is a dynamic, one-hour version of the musical based on the hit movie, designed especially for young performers. The tuner follows Dewey Finn, a failed, wannabe rock star who decides to earn an extra bit of cash by posing as a substitute teacher at a prestigious prep school. There he turns a class of straight-A pupils into a guitar-shredding, bass-slapping, mind-blowing rock band. But can he get them to the Battle of the Bands without their parents and the school’s headmistress finding out? The Playlist Cast performs on the following dates: Saturday, November 7 at 7pm Sunday, November 8 at 2pm Friday, November 13 at 7pm Saturday, November 14 at 2pm The Mixtape Cast performs on the following dates: Friday, November 6 at 7pm Saturday, November 7 at 2pm…', '2026-11-15T14:00:00-07:00', '2026-11-15T15:00:00-07:00', 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'music', array['Presenting Series','Presenting Series|Youth Program','Youth Program','pleasanton']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1252x720-scaled.jpg', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/pytc-school-of-rock-young-actors-edition/2026-11-15/', 'approved', 'scraper', '27181b5737bc'),
  ('BYOB Bring Your Own Bottle', 'byob-bring-your-own-bottle-82c663', 'Recycling is good but re-using is better! Bring your empty wine bottles for BYOB on the 3rd Sunday of each month and fill them with a delicious red blend for just 10.99 ea. Bring as many as you want! Don t have bottles We sell them for just 50 cents. Call for more information or to pre order 925 456-7676', '2026-11-15T16:30:00-07:00', null, 'Page Mill Winery', '1960 S. Livermore Ave, Livermore, CA 94550', 'food-drink', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510812431401-41d2bd2722f3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-livermore-valley-wine-country'), 'https://www.lvwine.org/events/2026/11/November.html', 'approved', 'scraper', '82c663c2cb91'),
