  ('Volunteer at Valley Humane Society', 'volunteer-at-valley-humane-society-f46f8f', 'Join Valley Humane Society''s valued team of volunteers for a rewarding experience that has a meaningful impact on the lives of animals and people in the community. Visit valleyhumane.org/volunteer.', '2026-11-22T10:00:00-07:00', null, null, 'Pleasanton, CA', 'community', array['pleasanton']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/68646135-c187-4347-82fb-2e38ce872f78.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/volunteer-at-valley-humane-society/13565994/2026-11-22T10', 'approved', 'scraper', 'f46f8f7dd9b6'),
  ('LARPD Puzzle Palooza', 'larpd-puzzle-palooza-a02d15', 'There will be 3 hours to complete a 1000-, 750-, or 500-piece puzzle, with a prize for the first team to finish! Register a team of up to four people to compete in the ultimate puzzle challenge. Upon arrival, teams will receive the mystery puzzle and a table to work on. Light refreshments and snacks will be available, and all teams get to keep their puzzles at the end of the competition. Only one team member needs to register. $48 Resident/$53 Non-resident per team Pick Your Puzzle Size: 1000, 750, 500 pieces Register Online at: https://www.larpd.org/puzzle-palooza-fall Kids of all ages are welcome! An adult must accompany children under 13.', '2026-11-22T13:00:00-07:00', null, 'Livermore Aquatic Center', 'Livermore, CA', 'festival', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, true, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/LvmYbxUWV0CGILxzYtvLNQ.large.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/larpd-puzzle-palooza/19733192/2026-11-22T13', 'approved', 'scraper', 'a02d15c27070'),
  ('A Song for You: The Music of Karen Carpenter At Christmas', 'a-song-for-you-the-music-of-karen-carpenter-at-christmas-983de8', 'Celebrate the holiday season with Laurie Roldan in “A Song For You: The Music of Karen Carpenter at Christmas ” This heartfelt cabaret concert brings the nostalgic magic of Karen Carpenter’s beloved Carpenters music and holiday songs to life. Featuring Laurie’s signature warm vocals, live musicians, and guest artists, the evening includes timeless Carpenters Christmas favorites like “Merry Christmas Darling,” “Sleigh Ride,”and “Winter Wonderland.” “Enjoy an early Christmas present featuring the gorgeous voice of Laurie Roldan for a nostalgic evening perfect for the impending holidays.” – Sally Hogarty, The East Bay Times SHE CHANNELED CARPENTER’S VOICE AND HER SPIRIT.” Edward A Kliszus, Opening Night and Front Row Center Reviews NYC “What is especially sweet in this production is Laurie’s own soft, poignant velvety voice that fits perfectly with the temper and similarly velvety voice…', '2026-11-22T14:00:00-07:00', '2026-11-22T16:00:00-07:00', 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'music', array['Presenting Series','Rental','pleasanton']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ChatGPT-Image-Jul-10-2026-02_51_52-PM.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/a-song-for-you-the-music-of-karen-carpenter-at-christmas/', 'approved', 'scraper', '983de80b1802'),
