  ('The Golden Follies – A Very Follies Holiday 2026', 'the-golden-follies-a-very-follies-holiday-2026-a9b6d4', 'Celebrate the season with The Golden Follies as these talented and energetic senior performers light up the stage with A Very ‘Follies’ Holiday! Enjoy lively choreography, heartwarming music, and a festive mix of reindeer, snowflakes, Christmas trees, brightly wrapped packages, and more. Share in the joy of the holidays as The Golden Follies bring together everything shiny and bright for a sparkling holiday revue — featuring special guest, the Bay Area’s dynamic vocal artist Deborah Del Mastro. And accompanying The Follies this season is percussionist Rusty King.', '2026-12-12T14:00:00-07:00', null, 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'community', array['Presenting Series','pleasanton']::text[], '$25 – $35', false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Very-Follies-Holiday-2026-web-1250x720-1.jpg', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/the-golden-follies-a-very-follies-holiday-2026/', 'approved', 'scraper', 'a9b6d4ff9dd7'),
