  ('Holiday Hustle 5K, 10K Livermore', 'holiday-hustle-5k-10k-livermore-0e041d', 'In teams of 1 to 5, adventure through the wonderfully decorated neighborhoods of Livermore, finding awesome holiday displays, and answering simple multiple choice questions about each... about 20 checkpoints on the 5K, 36 on the 10K. The start occurs just as darkness is settling in, so headlamps or flashlights will be most helpful. After the fun, return to some treats and socializing at the finish.', '2026-12-12T16:00:00-07:00', null, 'May Nissen Park, Picnic Area by Library building', 'Livermore, CA', 'sports', array['tri-valley']::text[], null, false, false, 'https://citysparkstorage.blob.core.windows.net/portalimages/portalimages/zoj6EIygWU6D5cLPnbHreA.large.jpg', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-pleasanton-weekly'), 'https://www.pleasantonweekly.com/calendar/#!/details/holiday-hustle-5k-10k-livermore/17984653/2026-12-12T16', 'approved', 'scraper', '0e041de457a4'),
