  ('Summer Night City – The ABBA Tribute', 'summer-night-city-the-abba-tribute-6b2a9f', 'Step into the sparkle, style, and unforgettable music of ABBA with Summer Night City, a dazzling tribute to one of pop music’s most iconic bands. Featuring authentic costumes, soaring harmonies, and timeless hits like “Dancing Queen,” “Mamma Mia,” and more, this high-energy performance captures the magic of the disco era. Whether you’re a lifelong fan or discovering ABBA for the first time, you’ll be singing along from the very first note. Grab your dancing shoes and get ready for an evening of pure pop nostalgia and nonstop fun! Learn more at https://summernightcityband.com/ .', '2026-12-18T19:30:00-07:00', null, 'Firehouse Arts Center', '4444 Railroad Ave., Pleasanton, CA, 94566', 'music', array['Presenting Series','pleasanton']::text[], '$45 – $52', false, false, 'https://www.firehousearts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Summer-Night-City-web-1920x1080-1.png', null, (select id from sources where slug = 'crawl-firehouse-arts-center'), 'https://www.firehousearts.org/calendar-event/summer-night-city/', 'approved', 'scraper', '6b2a9ff8a7a1'),
